Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 22:27:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 006/207] deepseek: discover Engram shards from the native
 asset tool

List Engram shard paths from an index-only source, preserving repository-relative paths and requiring an explicit prefix for bare filenames. Missing or unsafe index data gives an actionable refusal; no model shards or device are needed for discovery.

Ryan3040 reported the missing-index traceback and shard-discovery mismatch in issue #68. This already-started native change is isolated for the recipe owner after the scope split; pack generation, real download paths and recipe wiring remain separate work.
